      "  mendiang -> ISTILAH_UMUM_RITUAL [cultural]\n",
      "  pancamahabutha -> KONSEP_FILOSOFIS [cultural]\n",
      "\n",
      "S2958: namun kita yakin, bahwa sesuatu yadnya pasti akan siddhaning don (sukses).\n",
